Check out the [past release notes](https://github.com/tsundoku-otaku/tsundoku/releases) if you’re upgrading from an earlier version.

<!-->

## Improved
- Novel Extension Repo > Extension Store + Related fixes (@Rojikku}
- Import Stub isNovel improvements, fix last_read backup restore error, change quick + migrate to durable background jobs   @Rojikku}
- Handle picture/source/video/audio tags in text view (@mrissaoussama}
- avoid list copies during backup restore (@mrissaoussama}
- Improve UI filter panel with scroll, apply library filters (@mrissaoussama}
- Asset-rewrite logic uses relative paths for chapter embedder/local novels (@mrissaoussama}
- Add blank title/URL filter and category dialog to duplicate detection (@mrissaoussama}

## Fixed
- Prevent crash with setting search on duplicate key (@mrissaoussama}
- Fix importing new LNreader backups, all novels in DB come favorited (@mrissaoussama}
- Scope leading-slash normalization (@mrissaoussama}
- Recover .js plugin files renamed by SAF mimetype guessing (@mrissaoussama}
- Fix download-ahead gate bypassed for novels (@mrissaoussama}

## Other
- Merged v0.20.4 from Mihon (@Rojikku}

<!-->

> [!TIP]
>
> ### If you are unsure which version to download then go with `tsundoku-v0.3.1.apk`
